Hi Dana,

Thanks for the quick reply yesterday. I've talked with our marketing team, and we have two requests before we sign off on the plan.

1. Can we move the release of the ordering app update from Friday, March 19 to Friday, March 5? Our spring sale starts on Monday, March 8, and we'd love the new checkout to be live for it.

2. We'd also like to add a "Save for later" button on the product page, so customers can keep items in a list without buying them. Marketing thinks it will help with the sale.

I know this is a lot to ask. Let me know what's possible, and if a call would help, I'm free Thursday afternoon.

Best,
Rachel

